{emailSubject}Reference Solution Comment - {$exercise}{/emailSubject}
<h1>New reference solution comment of '{$exercise}'</h1>

<blockquote>{$comment}</blockquote>

<p>A comment was added by '{$author}' on {$date|localizedDate:'en'} to the reference solution of exercise '{$exercise}' submitted by '{$solutionAuthor}'.</p>

{if $otherComments > 0}
<p class="quiet">
    {$otherComments} further comment{if $otherComments > 1}s{/if} arrived in the meantime.
    The one above is the most recent; the rest are on the same page.
</p>
{/if}

{button($link, 'Open the reference solution')|noescape}
